```
Replace the ENTIRE field set of the selected metarecord (needs -i, force)

Usage: mf metarecord set [OPTIONS] <SPECS>...

Arguments:
  <SPECS>...
          Field spec name:type[=value]; repeatable

Options:
  -f, --force
          Mandatory: confirms the full-record overwrite

  -h, --help
          Print help
